#6401
Monastery Road~
   The road goes deeper into the trees here, a quiet track of packed
earth shaded by tall oaks and beeches.  Their branches meet overhead,
and the light that filters through the leaves is soft and green.
Further down the road to the north you can make out the outline of the
Monastery's gray stone walls.  The road also leads back south.
~
