#6402
Further Down Monastery Road~
   To the east you can see a large monastery, very simple in design:
walls of dark timber set with stained glass windows, and a large marble
symbol mounted above the entranceway.  The steady thud of an axe on wood
comes from the yard.  The road continues north and south.
~
