#6406
Middle of the Main Hallway~
   You stand in the middle of the main hallway of the Monastery.  The
walls are of plain whitewashed stone, and the floor is laid with smooth
slate swept perfectly clean.  Simple wooden benches line the walls, and
the air is cool and smells faintly of incense.  The hallway continues
east towards the training grounds and west towards the Monastery's
entrance.
