#6421
Working Section of Library~
   This library is either very well stocked, or the busy monks have been
copying texts and scrolls very industriously indeed.  Bookshelves fill
the rooms to the north and south, and several tables and chairs stand
about this section, strewn with inkpots and half-finished manuscripts.
A desk stands against the far wall.  The only exit is to the east.
