#6424
Sanctum of the Monastery~
   The monks gather here to pray to the gods at various times of the
day, and at any hour a few of them can be found here chanting, praying
or humming.  Rows of woven mats cover the floor, and incense curls up
toward a small round window in the ceiling.  The entrance lies to the
north, and the dining hall to the east.
~
