Entrance to the Training Grounds~
   Beyond the master's watchful post you can see and hear monks sparring
with bare hands and feet, but you get the impression that you could not
pass unless he thought you worthy of testing yourself.  Several large,
informative signs hang on the wall.  The training grounds lie east, a
hallway leads north, and the main hallway lies west.
