#6426
Dining Hall~
   A long table fills this room, so long that it could probably seat the
entire monastery at once, though they would hardly all eat at the same
time, since someone always seems to be training or praying.  Wooden
bowls and spoons are stacked neatly at one end.  The kitchen lies east,
the sanctum west and the main hallway north.
