#6427
The Kitchen~
   The cook prepares most of the monastery's food here, despite the odd
hours that some of the monks keep.  Pots and ladles hang above a
firepit, and baskets of vegetables crowd the corners.  A trapdoor in the
floor leads down to the cellar, and a sign on it catches your eye.  The
dining hall lies to the west.
~
