1 0 6428
E
sign~
               BOLD ADVENTURERS!!

   Recently, it seems that some nasty little monsters made a hole in our wall
downstairs in the Cellar. We soundly trashed them and none of them have enough
courage to enter the Cellar again, however, the Monastery would appreciate it
if you would help us keep their numbers down and fear in their hearts.
   Though the Monastery could easily purge the menace, we just don't feel like
taking the time away from our prayers and training to do this. Any assistance
you provide would be appreciated and you may keep anything you find down
there as a reward for your help.
~
S
#6428
Cellar Under the Monastery~
   This cellar is lit by soft magical lights and stocked with casks,
sacks of grain and strings of dried onions.  A ragged hole has been
broken through the south wall, opening into a tunnel lit by some sort of
green light.  The only other exit is the trapdoor up to the kitchen.
~
