#6430
Green Glowing Intersection~
   This part of the tunnel is brightly lit by some sort of green,
glowing fungi that cling in thick clusters to the walls and ceiling.
Their eerie light gives everything a sickly tint, including your own
skin.  The air is damp and smells of mold.  Tunnels lead north towards a
hole in the wall, east into more of the glowing tunnel, and south to a
dimly lit intersection.
