#6441
Edge of a Deep, Dark Pit~
   The tunnel ends abruptly at the steep side of a deep, dark pit.
Growls and snorts echo up from below, and a foul smell rises out of it.
You think to yourself, "This has GOT to be where all of the monsters are
coming from!"  The tunnel leads back east.
