The Monk's Guild~
   This open field serves as the training ground for monks from all over
the continent.  The greatest monks have trained here, as well as the
not-so-great ones, and broken logs and shredded dummies lie strewn
everywhere.  The grass has been worn away in great circles where pairs
of monks spar.  The entrance lies to the west.
